Package: icesAdviceSheet
Title: Draft ICES Advice Sheets from SID, SAG and ASD
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Neil", "Campbell", email = "neilcampbelll@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates draft ICES advice sheets as Word documents for a
    given stock and assessment year. Stock information comes from the ICES
    Stock Information Database (SID), assessment results, confidence bounds
    and reference points from Stock Assessment Graphs (SAG), and the advice,
    catch scenarios and advice history from the Advice and Scenarios
    Database (ASD). The draft uses the ICES advice template, draws the ICES
    standard graphs, and marks missing or inconsistent data, and text still
    to be written by the expert group, for follow-up.
